  "issue": {
    "id": "I_kwDOCBF7SM6zmZRw",
    "databaseId": 3013186672,
    "number": 5100,
    "title": "Bug in parameter configuration in controller.",
    "url": "https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2/issues/5100",
    "body": "I think I have found a bug related to parameter configuration in the controller. \n\nI started the robot as usual this morning and it gave me this configuration error on startup.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0e627c6c-0430-4a35-a16e-4e27f773b73a)\n\nIt says that ``The value of parameter 'MPPI.vx_min' is incorrectly set to -0.350000, it should be >=0. Ignoring parameter update.``.\n\nI looked at the documentation and this is the  default value: https://docs.nav2.org/configuration/packages/configuring-mppic.html\n\nI also looked at this part of the code and I found it in the RPP controller!!! \n\nhttps://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2/blob/5423eba732ed16b4f97a7353027c1f444b6edc60/nav2_regulated_pure_pursuit_controller/src/parameter_handler.cpp#L230-L234\n\nMaybe this is related to this PR #4971 ",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I think I have found a bug related to parameter configuration in the controller.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I started the robot as usual this morning and it gave me this configuration error on startup.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/4681902/436442772-0e627c6c-0430-4a35-a16e-4e27f773b73a.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..wSztNAWybYfVKIWMgNEPxPzU4hRNaVEtrIzQjUhMvOc\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/4681902/436442772-0e627c6c-0430-4a35-a16e-4e27f773b73a.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..wSztNAWybYfVKIWMgNEPxPzU4hRNaVEtrIzQjUhMvOc\" alt=\"Image\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It says that <code class=\"notranslate\">The value of parameter 'MPPI.vx_min' is incorrectly set to -0.350000, it should be &gt;=0. Ignoring parameter update.</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I looked at the documentation and this is the  default value: <a href=\"https://docs.nav2.org/configuration/packages/configuring-mppic.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.nav2.org/configuration/packages/configuring-mppic.html</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I also looked at this part of the code and I found it in the RPP controller!!!</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><div class=\"Box Box--condensed my-2\">\n  <div class=\"Box-header f6\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-bold\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2/blob/5423eba732ed16b4f97a7353027c1f444b6edc60/nav2_regulated_pure_pursuit_controller/src/parameter_handler.cpp#L230-L234\">navigation2/nav2_regulated_pure_pursuit_controller/src/parameter_handler.cpp</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mb-0 color-fg-muted\">\n        Lines 230 to 234\n      in\n      <a data-pjax=\"true\" class=\"commit-tease-sha Link--inTextBlock\" href=\"/ros-navigation/navigation2/commit/5423eba732ed16b4f97a7353027c1f444b6edc60\">5423eba</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"Box-body p-0 blob-wrapper blob-wrapper-embedded data\">\n    <table class=\"highlight tab-size mb-0 js-file-line-container\" data-tab-size=\"8\" data-paste-markdown-skip=\"\">\n\n        <tbody><tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L230\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"230\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC230\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> <span class=\"pl-c1\">RCLCPP_WARN</span>( </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L231\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"231\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC231\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> logger_, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>The value of parameter '%s' is incorrectly set to %f, <span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L232\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"232\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC232\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>it should be &gt;=0. Ignoring parameter update.<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L233\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"233\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC233\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> name.<span class=\"pl-c1\">c_str</span>(), parameter.<span class=\"pl-c1\">as_double</span>()); </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L234\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"234\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC234\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> result.<span class=\"pl-smi\">successful</span> = <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>; </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Maybe this is related to this PR <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2902963821\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2/issues/4971\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/ros-navigation/navigation2/pull/4971/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2/pull/4971\">#4971</a></p>",
